  "Range 512–4096, step 32. The node searches for a matching fixed-point size from the source ratio and tol_ratio.": "范围 512–4096，步进 32。节点会根据原图比例和 tol_ratio 搜索对应的不动点尺寸。",
  "Set the shortcut that opens the Asset Manager. It takes effect immediately and works while the panel is closed.": "设置打开资产管理器的快捷键。保存后立即生效，关闭面板后也可以使用。",
  "The main model and mmproj must come from the same model family. For text-only use, set mmproj to None (text-only).": "主模型与 mmproj 需要来自同一模型系列。纯文本可把 mmproj 设为“无（纯文本）”。",
