  "The model exists locally, but its value is missing from this node's dropdown. Refresh the model list and scan again.": "本地已经找到模型，但当前节点的下拉列表里没有该值；请刷新模型列表后重新扫描。",
  "Select the GGUF main model for local chat and prompt processing; audio, images and video also need a matching mmproj.": "选择用于本地对话和提示词处理的 GGUF 主模型；音频、图片和视频还需要匹配的 mmproj。",
