  "Tags are prompt-inspiration assets. Use + beside a category or subcategory to add tags in bulk, one per line or separated by commas or semicolons.": "标签是提示词灵感素材。点击分类或二级分类旁的 + 可以批量新增标签；每行一个，也支持用逗号或分号分隔。",
  "Select a mmproj from the same family as the main model. For text-only use, set it to None; images, video frame extraction and Gemma4 audio need it.": "选择与主模型同系列的 mmproj。纯文本可设为“无”；图片、视频抽帧和 Gemma4 音频需要它。",
  "Find stale model dropdown values in the current workflow. When SHA256 is available, match by content only and never replace a different model by name; ": "扫描当前工作流中已经失效的模型下拉项。有 SHA256 时只按内容匹配，不会用同名文件替代不同模型；",
  "Shared by the plain-text, image and multimodal external API modes; optional fields the endpoint does not support are removed automatically and retried.": "纯文本、图片和多模态三种外部 API 模式共用；接口不支持的可选字段会自动移除后重试。",
