  "Multiple same-name matches and hash conflicts still require confirmation. Filling only changes the current workflow; it does not copy, move, or delete local model files.": "多个同名和哈希冲突仍需人工确认。填充只修改当前工作流，不复制、移动或删除本地模型文件。",
