  "Enter RGB values from 0–255, for example 0,0,0. Positive grow values expand outward; negative values shrink inward. These parameters are saved with the node workflow and affect the mask and mask_image outputs.": "颜色填写 0–255 的 RGB，例如 0,0,0。扩展生长为正数时向外膨胀，负数时向内收缩。参数会随节点工作流一起保存，并影响 mask 与 mask_image 输出。",
  "Drag inside the box to move it, drag the eight handles to resize, and drag outside the box to draw a new selection. Custom sizes output at that width and height, scaling up proportionally when the source is too small; the crop box can still be moved before applying. A crop that has not been applied is also applied automatically on final upload.": "拖动框内移动，拖动八个控制点改变大小；在框外拖动可重新框选。自定义尺寸会按该宽高输出，源图不足时自动等比放大；应用前仍可移动裁剪框。最终上传时尚未应用的裁切也会自动应用。",
  "Find stale model dropdown values in the current workflow. When SHA256 is available, match by content only and never replace a different model by name. With Auto-fill after scan enabled, only models matching by hash, original path, or a unique local name are filled automatically; multiple same-name matches and hash conflicts still require confirmation. Filling only changes the current workflow and does not copy, move, or delete local model files.": "扫描当前工作流中已经失效的模型下拉项。有 SHA256 时只按内容匹配，不会用同名文件替代不同模型；勾选“扫描后自动填充”时，只自动填充哈希/原路径一致或本地唯一同名的模型；多个同名和哈希冲突仍需人工确认。填充只修改当前工作流，不复制、移动或删除本地模型文件。",
